	)
	(text "SEL pin sets PD voltage request - verify correct resistor value\nagainst IP2721 datasheet for 9V profile before ordering PCB.\nVBUSG must be tied to VIN. Floating VBUSG prevents output enable\nafter negotiation regardless of CC state."
